<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-17T23:02:30.401Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:02:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan-linked actors are again implicated in violent incidents, with arrests of PTI leaders tied to a Radio Pakistan attack and two suspects detained for a railway-track blast in Rajasthan that killed two people. In Balochistan a separatist-claimed drone strike killed six Pakistani soldiers and a motorcycle bomb in Bara wounded two civilians, while a child was killed by a mortar shell explosion in Ghazni, Afghanistan. Pakistan showcased the Arrow‑1 strike drone with stealth features and possible Raad cruise missile linkages, and a border monitoring report documented inflows from Iran. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE41d3oxejBXYjZNM3dYTWM3czR5TERDOTY3QmxhRmdyX2doUTNtR2NoMnl1TEVKbkttc3pKTlMzZnU2QzhfNEJ6RmZuUWV6YjdjZklSRlRCSEliWlhyUUdQWWxnVU1KWVA5QUxpalpjc0FqYWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Substack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPVWdERTQ0QjBhNTRxbEtPRXhjbUVib2lVTy0wOGNtVHJfZDlMVjlSRUR5cVM5MFNYSEh5NzZJZ2d2MGcySktPRzlwbXhQZEl0LUhCeU1pRDkxam5YQjNqSmpvZUdvckhoNGtNNzd5VWRyMlhzLUgtVF95eUFfX2llNHpPbXV3OXRzc1ZxTlVpeGtDMlRsWUZQb1BOUEkxQ3RjT1lDRnlGd01abHhZTUpj?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Independent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNMVlGUjN4Z25vRm9mSmN6bHlfalppZjQ3d0tkSUg3VE1HMzdrX1RuSXFQTFhqOUJrRnNVeng2Z211R1B0M0R5a3V1ZWZqS0FRSFZTbjFYWi1wZXBVNEIzNmg4MEZBYlZDSUVVanRxbWpVNmtYRlVkZUVlU3NBMXNUVkdUbVdwUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;8AM Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOWHc1NFE1TE9OVTBpX0I5eHF1S19UZ2hlSWtFY0FBRVhfQ0xraXJOS3RLNTg0QWdydVM2VVVFdTBuYlRFTjA1bHN